type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/18/0936836/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-ha011d76724":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうもこんばんは！ななみです(o^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今乃木坂では風邪が流行中でして。\nみんな声ガラガラです(+_+)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今風邪や胃腸炎が流行ってるみたいなので\nみなさん気をつけましょーう(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの間のお正月イベントの前に\n朝からお仕事がありましてね、\n移動のバスがいくちゃんと隣だったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝て顔がむくまないように\n私が寝かけたらいくちゃん\n手をギュッて握って起こしてくれるんです！(''*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが何回かあって\n「もぉ〜、じゃあ寝ないようにお話しよ(´・ω・｀)？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひゃーかわいすぎ！！！\nやばくないですか？(*゜▽゜*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして待ち時間\nあすかとみなみが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ななみん、なんか面白いことしてー(*゜▽゜*)キラキラ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(・o・)…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよう…\n中学生の笑いのツボを\nピンポイントでプッシュするのは\n今の私には難しい…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},